  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven she prices it at half an immortal essence stone, the lowest price for a rank five killer move. It needs many rank five Gu, and the defense is a wide range defensive effect. Fang Yuan names those two points as reasons it is hard to sell. He then buys icy yarn together with her small killer move six-nine stardust for that half stone.",
