      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Without icy yarn and six-nine stardust, he would not have been able to deduce icy drill stardust. When he saw the two moves, he judged they were the foundation of Little Immortal Xing Luo’s self-created killer move.",
